infinite-patch 1
# Notes: notes that make patterns
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id seq
  pos 0 318
end
node 2 Notes Arpeggiator
  id arp
  pos 1060 318
end
node 3 Synths Analog
  id synth
  pos 1560 302
end
node 4 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
  pos 2420 156
end
node 5 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text Notes nodes make and change musical notes. Wire them into a synth to hear them.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 156
  s text The Sequencer plays a row of steps. Click steps to turn them on, and drag them to change notes.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 7 Compositing Comment
  pos 1060 156
  s text The Arpeggiator turns each note into a run of notes. Try Mode and Octaves.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 8 Compositing Comment
  pos 1560 156
  s text Any synth can play these notes.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
note arp 0 seq
note synth 0 arp
aud speakers 0 synth
